1. Bundled into the device app
------------------------------

`deno task bundle` compiles packages/web into packages/web/dist, which the
bridge serves to phones and tablets. The packages come from npm (deno.json
"imports", locked in deno.lock); they are fetched by `deno install`, not
committed.

