3. Fonts
--------

The font files are downloaded by `deno task --cwd packages/web fonts` from
the pinned URLs in packages/web/public/fonts/fonts.manifest.json, checked
against their SHA-256 there, and are not committed. Each family's license is
committed as packages/web/public/fonts/<family>/OFL.txt (SIL Open Font
License 1.1).

